-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;" data-ref="23fcae49-bbb5-4766-af5e-414f5323ee49" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="4f85c0f1-c451-424f-946b-865e858d2b47"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="109ebf49-f5d9-4cfa-af12-be09034887a2"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D451 TEX-I" data-ref="91f8edb0-48a1-404e-8cc9-4c63094b767f"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="482f0b97-2281-448e-a445-921116570e4c"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="82b8e464-352b-4e74-b047-e37400419ea5"><mi data-ref="bfc1065b-71bc-494a-9816-aa2553eb0efa">d</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers â€” the keys to be deleted from the B-Tree.</li><li data-ref="3e9e6a66-b5ee-4a5e-9801-1e4bcb900838">The sixth line contains a single integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;" data-ref="95fc8707-6557-4e6a-9ae6-c3e7f3404e6e" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="898a1d06-a7f5-44b3-9ed3-2ac980458bfd"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="4d39dd2f-177a-45b7-b3a0-81d5635185f4"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D458 TEX-I" data-ref="116a4505-b5e8-4e90-982d-8adbb243d48e"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="721ebd1c-cd22-4bd5-8a76-872b3f61170e"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="85e4dbb3-3f4b-40d6-9529-3a0d4a74b0c0"><mi data-ref="5af8d763-c756-423c-a405-04585ad990e7">k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> â€” the key to be searched in the B-Tree.</li></ul><p data-ref="4ba8be41-f783-4409-98ec-99e07196b9d0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="e13ef971-e93f-414a-89d4-214ebbd8a8dd"></p><p data-ref="6ea39d76-f490-43c0-bb53-837c40a8a9af" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="1eddc505-739f-4e67-b61d-7eb6c206f78e">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="97d1cece-0d9b-45c1-8f4a-52fea42ea1c1" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="34dff46b-0ab0-40bf-abbc-75caba4cd273">The first line of output should display the inorder traversal of the B-Tree after all insertions, with each key separated by a space.</li><li data-ref="16f64539-6a1c-4ce7-bf2d-d0c4fba08e18">The second line should display the inorder traversal of the B-Tree after all deletions, with each key separated by a space.</li><li data-ref="f2c7c63a-b037-486c-bb34-be28cc8d2a5e">The third line should print <strong data-ref="9a5b7d68-cc6d-402d-aad7-afb65368858b">Found</strong> if the search key exists in the B-Tree. If the key is not present, print <strong data-ref="bf1f17a8-bbda-410d-bf7e-26477a3977e0">Not Found</strong> instead.</li></ul><p data-ref="d3e5ee36-2bfd-49ba-97b0-a4ec7ca4079e" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d512f24c-b4b0-4a78-9d84-8524cd54e588"></p><p data-ref="78c88c30-c3f0-47a7-95b5-e9e443076939" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="8f7abfbc-ed15-4ba8-8bc2-ee38f22f4215"></p><p data-ref="c8a12849-8cef-4b87-904f-ac035d255fd7" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="f9e019ad-8ee7-442f-9507-7a993895be66">Note: </strong>Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="f5f5016e-e945-4d43-ae8e-9567ac33a16a"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="99b609fc-a791-4b35-9170-1130f390aea0"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="ca962270-b5ca-4268-86f6-2e4e14217938" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="468adc7b-506e-43c0-9d78-1bd09f1e19b1" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="668a1f05-b2f0-4901-9412-5ab1986a767a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Btreemain.c</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="08ce0932-1842-42c9-9d2a-9a418f37f360" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;
#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;
#include &lt;stdbool.h&gt;

typedef struct BTreeNode {
int *keys;
int t;
struct BTreeNode **C;
int n;
bool leaf;
} BTreeNode;


BTreeNode* createNode(int t, bool leaf) {
	BTreeNode* node = (BTreeNode*)malloc(sizeof(BTreeNode));
	node-&gt;t = t;
	node-&gt;leaf = leaf;
	node-&gt;keys = (int*)malloc((2 * t - 1) * sizeof(int));
	node-&gt;C = (BTreeNode**)malloc((2 * t) * sizeof(BTreeNode*));
	node-&gt;n = 0;
	return node;
}


void inorder(BTreeNode* root) {
	if (!root) return;
	for (int i = 0; i &lt; root-&gt;n; i++) {
		if (!root-&gt;leaf)
			inorder(root-&gt;C[i]);
		printf("%d ", root-&gt;keys[i]);
	}
	if (!root-&gt;leaf)
		inorder(root-&gt;C[root-&gt;n]);
}


bool search(BTreeNode* root, int k) {
	int i = 0;
	while (i &lt; root-&gt;n &amp;&amp; k &gt; root-&gt;keys[i])
		i++;
	if (i &lt; root-&gt;n &amp;&amp; root-&gt;keys[i] == k)
		return true;
	if (root-&gt;leaf)
		return false;
	return search(root-&gt;C[i], k);
}

void splitChild(BTreeNode* x, int i) {
	int t = x-&gt;t;
	BTreeNode* y = x-&gt;C[i];
	BTreeNode* z = createNode(t, y-&gt;leaf);
	z-&gt;n = t - 1;
	for (int j = 0; j &lt; t - 1; j++)
		z-&gt;keys[j] = y-&gt;keys[j + t];
	if (!y-&gt;leaf) {
		for (int j = 0; j &lt; t; j++)
			z-&gt;C[j] = y-&gt;C[j + t];
	}
	y-&gt;n = t - 1;
	for (int j = x-&gt;n; j &gt;= i + 1; j--)
		x-&gt;C[j + 1] = x-&gt;C[j];
	x-&gt;C[i + 1] = z;
	for (int j = x-&gt;n - 1; j &gt;= i; j--)
		x-&gt;keys[j + 1] = x-&gt;keys[j];
	x-&gt;keys[i] = y-&gt;keys[t - 1];
	x-&gt;n++;
}


void insertNonFull(BTreeNode* x, int k) {
	int i = x-&gt;n - 1;
	if (x-&gt;leaf) {
		while (i &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; k &lt; x-&gt;keys[i]) {
			x-&gt;keys[i + 1] = x-&gt;keys[i];
			i--;
		}
		x-&gt;keys[i + 1] = k;
		x-&gt;n++;
	} else {
		while (i &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; k &lt; x-&gt;keys[i])
			i--;
		i++;
		if (x-&gt;C[i]-&gt;n == 2 * x-&gt;t - 1) {
			splitChild(x, i);
			if (k &gt; x-&gt;keys[i])
				i++;
		}
		insertNonFull(x-&gt;C[i], k);
	}
}


void insert(BTreeNode** rootRef, int k) {
	BTreeNode* r = *rootRef;
	if (r-&gt;n == 2 * r-&gt;t - 1) {
		BTreeNode* s = createNode(r-&gt;t, false);
		s-&gt;C[0] = r;
		splitChild(s, 0);
		int i = (k &gt; s-&gt;keys[0]) ? 1 : 0;
		insertNonFull(s-&gt;C[i], k);
		*rootRef = s;
	} else {
		insertNonFull(r, k);
	}
}


int getPred(BTreeNode* x) {
	while (!x-&gt;leaf)
		x = x-&gt;C[x-&gt;n];
	return x-&gt;keys[x-&gt;n - 1];
}


int getSucc(BTreeNode* x) {
	while (!x-&gt;leaf)
		x = x-&gt;C[0];
	return x-&gt;keys[0];
}


void merge(BTreeNode* x, int idx) {
	BTreeNode* c1 = x-&gt;C[idx];
	BTreeNode* c2 = x-&gt;C[idx + 1];
	int t = x-&gt;t;
	c1-&gt;keys[t - 1] = x-&gt;keys[idx];
	for (int i = 0; i &lt; c2-&gt;n; ++i)
		c1-&gt;keys[i + t] = c2-&gt;keys[i];
	if (!c1-&gt;leaf) {
		for (int i = 0; i &lt;= c2-&gt;n; ++i)
			c1-&gt;C[i + t] = c2-&gt;C[i];
	}
	for (int i = idx + 1; i &lt; x-&gt;n; ++i)
		x-&gt;keys[i - 1] = x-&gt;keys[i];
	for (int i = idx + 2; i &lt;= x-&gt;n; ++i)
		x-&gt;C[i - 1] = x-&gt;C[i];
	c1-&gt;n += c2-&gt;n + 1;
	x-&gt;n--;
	free(c2);
}


void fill(BTreeNode* x, int idx) {
	int t = x-&gt;t;
	if (idx &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; x-&gt;C[idx - 1]-&gt;n &gt;= t) {
		BTreeNode* child = x-&gt;C[idx];
		BTreeNode* sibling = x-&gt;C[idx - 1];
		for (int i = child-&gt;n - 1; i &gt;= 0; --i)
			child-&gt;keys[i + 1] = child-&gt;keys[i];
		if (!child-&gt;leaf) {
			for (int i = child-&gt;n; i &gt;= 0; --i)
				child-&gt;C[i + 1] = child-&gt;C[i];
		}
		child-&gt;keys[0] = x-&gt;keys[idx - 1];
		if (!child-&gt;leaf)
			child-&gt;C[0] = sibling-&gt;C[sibling-&gt;n];
		x-&gt;keys[idx - 1] = sibling-&gt;keys[sibling-&gt;n - 1];
		child-&gt;n += 1;
		sibling-&gt;n -= 1;
	} else if (idx &lt; x-&gt;n &amp;&amp; x-&gt;C[idx + 1]-&gt;n &gt;= t) {
		BTreeNode* child = x-&gt;C[idx];
		BTreeNode* sibling = x-&gt;C[idx + 1];
		child-&gt;keys[child-&gt;n] = x-&gt;keys[idx];
		if (!child-&gt;leaf)
			child-&gt;C[child-&gt;n + 1] = sibling-&gt;C[0];
		x-&gt;keys[idx] = sibling-&gt;keys[0];
		for (int i = 1; i &lt; sibling-&gt;n; ++i)
			sibling-&gt;keys[i - 1] = sibling-&gt;keys[i];
		if (!sibling-&gt;leaf) {
			for (int i = 1; i &lt;= sibling-&gt;n; ++i)
				sibling-&gt;C[i - 1] = sibling-&gt;C[i];
		}
		child-&gt;n += 1;
		sibling-&gt;n -= 1;
	} else {
		if (idx != x-&gt;n)
			merge(x, idx);
		else
			merge(x, idx - 1);
	}
}


void removeFromNode(BTreeNode* x, int k) {
	int idx = 0;
	while (idx &lt; x-&gt;n &amp;&amp; x-&gt;keys[idx] &lt; k)
		++idx;
	if (idx &lt; x-&gt;n &amp;&amp; x-&gt;keys[idx] == k) {
		if (x-&gt;leaf) {
			for (int i = idx + 1; i &lt; x-&gt;n; ++i)
				x-&gt;keys[i - 1] = x-&gt;keys[i];
			x-&gt;n--;
		} else {
			if (x-&gt;C[idx]-&gt;n &gt;= x-&gt;t) {
				int pred = getPred(x-&gt;C[idx]);
				x-&gt;keys[idx] = pred;
				removeFromNode(x-&gt;C[idx], pred);
			} else if (x-&gt;C[idx + 1]-&gt;n &gt;= x-&gt;t) {
				int succ = getSucc(x-&gt;C[idx + 1]);
				x-&gt;keys[idx] = succ;
				removeFromNode(x-&gt;C[idx + 1], succ);
			} else {
				merge(x, idx);
				removeFromNode(x-&gt;C[idx], k);
			}
		}
	} else {
		if (x-&gt;leaf)
			return;
		bool flag = (idx == x-&gt;n);
		if (x-&gt;C[idx]-&gt;n &lt; x-&gt;t)
			fill(x, idx);
		if (flag &amp;&amp; idx &gt; x-&gt;n)
			removeFromNode(x-&gt;C[idx - 1], k);
		else
			removeFromNode(x-&gt;C[idx], k);
	}
}


void deleteKey(BTreeNode** rootRef, int k) {
	BTreeNode* r = *rootRef;
	removeFromNode(r, k);
	if (r-&gt;n == 0) {
		BTreeNode* tmp = r;
		if (r-&gt;leaf)
			*rootRef = NULL;
		else
			*rootRef = r-&gt;C[0];
		free(tmp);
	}
}


int main() {
	int t;
	scanf("%d", &amp;t);
	BTreeNode* root = createNode(t, true);
	int n, val;
	scanf("%d", &amp;n);
	for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {
		scanf("%d", &amp;val);
		insert(&amp;root, val);
	}
	inorder(root);
	int d;
	scanf("%d", &amp;d);
	for (int i = 0; i &lt; d; i++) {
		scanf("%d", &amp;val);
		deleteKey(&amp;root, val);
	}
	inorder(root);
	int target;
	scanf("%d\n", &amp;target);
	if (search(root, target))
		printf("Found\n");
	else
		printf("Not Found\n");
	return 0;
}</pre><br data-ref="025f63d4-58d6-4c95-8e2c-3d1131ab5d7d"></div></div><div class="row" data-ref="66c66947-9ae3-4747-b4a4-4e4241252afb"><div class="col-12" data-ref="085e5c4e-214d-4f38-9c4c-f8cb16615fee"><h5 class="execResultsHeading text-center" data-ref="2523d086-f0fe-4f40-b959-0bf4aef1e76d">Execution Results <span class="executionResultsStatusSpan" style="font-size:0.9rem;" data-ref="d9d884fc-f439-4dca-bbae-826d3c992807" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">- All test cases have succeeded!</span></h5></div></div><div class="mb-4 mx-4" data-ref="81f1aa1d-e8df-49cf-b3b0-42d1976e428b"><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="a790c8ff-23c1-4e52-a3b4-fbca9c6393e0"><div class="col-12 p-2 text-center font-weight-bold" data-ref="2ffc4709-abba-4ef3-a7f9-e06394f517f7">Test Case - 1</div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="aefe6972-2074-4073-ac49-642e9f9f67ce"><div class="col-12 p-1 ml-2 font-weight-bold" data-ref="d367a7bd-45db-4d54-9304-f65027598ef1">User Output</div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="787b0dff-37af-4ff2-ad7b-f3b8436f84e7"><div class="col-6" data-ref="4d4fb4fb-266b-4714-9ead-f54cdabbc3a0"><span class="cmd" title="User Input" data-ref="b8048082-d796-4cfc-afa6-17d187a1f5e5">2</span></div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="1c4ca211-a8fd-4e59-b983-d4473242c76d"><div class="col-6" data-ref="071fc785-452a-410d-b270-8ef54e8b4b85"><span class="cmd" title="User Input" data-ref="0416e9f9-c465-4f9f-ac0c-2354c27af880">7</span></div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="b745b24d-b9a2-40ee-b07c-2d28ed1786e4"><div class="col-6" data-ref="07520786-dcd9-4e8b-b38b-d580cf7ee8e0"><span class="cmd" title="User Input" data-ref="3bde0238-d47b-4b6c-ab41-3f873a3f36cd">10 20 5 6 12 30 7</span></div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="056062f1-c9e8-4753-b3d1-2dea492d31e3"><div class="col-6" data-ref="77fea9b9-80e0-44a9-b8aa-75d58d813d84"><span class="cmd" title="User In