math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers â€” the values to insert into the heap.</li><li data-ref="e68cbce8-f14d-4c56-bb70-6558d361cb4c">The third line contains an integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;" data-ref="1fbb70b7-9932-4c28-a95a-e9724aff4249" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="5214b986-e58c-4f1d-90aa-9c3be90b0940"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="bbc42de7-638e-4d6c-aa7f-7f48cd656d26"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D458 TEX-I" data-ref="6f01a464-3d50-4db8-95a1-62107f07de6a"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="58c00973-b928-409b-b6e8-fd119e78cae5"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="4b4e7867-760a-4f69-b2a4-e2e71fa6aba7"><mi data-ref="2058f6f4-beb0-4fc7-b908-f5ca852ccde4">k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, representing the number of times the root (minimum element) should be deleted from the heap.</li></ul><p data-ref="a6f48704-a10c-43c1-8ba3-7eade8857b72" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="cdcaa8ec-0aa7-41df-9733-244fef892d3d"></p><p data-ref="56bd6744-7ae1-4d6f-a09e-b282db30a850" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="f8dab38e-8daf-46a8-9464-01d1a1867231">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-