:1px solid black;" data-ref="03bb86a3-2f29-4b29-a358-4d19a42b42ea" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Aim:</b><br data-ref="b012bdd6-fcc6-4989-a2cb-60b65602278f"><span class="question-text ql-editor" data-ref="b12a34a4-6dd1-4468-91ac-ae2f776de241"><p data-ref="f94d6967-effa-4bc7-ae8d-fed319a6afc9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0">Write a program to perform Depth First Search (DFS) traversal on an undirected graph using an adjacency matrix representation. The program should take the number of vertices, edges, and the starting vertex as input and print the DFS traversal of the graph.</p><p data-ref="34478a88-e521-4070-a6a2-249f4d04c6b5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="43fb81ad-78a5-4624-b534-fdeb18992b1a"></p><p data-ref="b41b5d39-71f2-42a4-914d-edb2aac03f27" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="b892682c-fb8c-43d3-83bb-e978fcfe05db">Input Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="df1e9f79-a7f8-4c9a-a0a0-1c9245294af9" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6