f 0s and 1s, where 1 represents a queen.</li><li data-ref="dff4b123-ef74-43d3-82b1-917b35abf038">If no solution exists, print: "No solution exists for N = &lt;value&gt;".</li><li data-ref="ba14f582-b86f-4039-898e-c1087aaf8399">Each row of the matrix should be printed on a new line, with space-separated values.</li></ul><p data-ref="623d7ca6-240f-40a5-bd1f-179dc9816a9c" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="b3f3b411-0a5b-491e-8161-3c2cb77caa21"></p><p data-ref="aecf8f77-cf1c-4cc7-8516-1f6b02c7b5dc" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="d210bab6-01e2-40da-9e4a-2ef3cdb25058">Note:</strong> Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="bd6b1123-144d-42e8-8980-65ff844053f8" data-split-to="bd6b1123-144d-42e8-8980-65ff844053f8" data-split-original="true" data-last-split-element="true" data-align-last-split-element="auto"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="83529795-416d-45f7-a956-f2b435ec04af"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="3a30196f-ff2d-4e9b-add0-f3dea8129a4a" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
